# LF in the repository, whatever the working tree looks like.
#
# Loom's files are all LF today, so this pins a state rather than fixing one -
# which is the cheap moment to do it. Nib had to normalise 28 files after a tool
# rewrote them with the other convention and cost a whole-file diff; Jot still
# has two files in CRLF for the same reason. Sibling projects have no business
# disagreeing about this.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Left alone byte for byte. A text filter here would corrupt them.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
